     "claim": "K_hook",
     "type": "established",
     "claim_text": "March 2009: Spanish police arrested a 66-year-old Chilean man at Barcelona's El Prat airport, arriving from Santiago, Chile, wearing a leg cast made of compressed cocaine (police: the first cast they had seen made entirely of the drug; it weighed about a kilogram). Narration: 'Police say his leg cast was made of cocaine.' Headline 'A LEG CAST / MADE OF COCAINE'. Accused only: never named, silhouette.",
     "urls": [
      "https://www.nbcnews.com/news/amp/wbna29564568",
